cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "MangueTREE: structural and phytosociological analysis of mangrove forest plots"
abstract: "Python engine and Streamlit app that computes forest structure, phytosociology (relative values and importance value), DBH classes and the Holdridge complexity index from stem-level field data of mangrove plots."
type: software
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-11-19
license: MIT
